    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a8/Yomi_Austere_Ninja_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250617003229\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Yomi Austere Ninja Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a8/Yomi_Austere_Ninja_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250617003229\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"582\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Yomi Austere Ninja Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Yomi_Austere_Ninja_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>朴素忍者</b>\n</p><p>正义使者\n夜美爆发\n全名\n夜美\n别名\n豆芽面具(她的英雄舞台别名)\n起源\n闪乱神乐\n职业\n恶忍(以前)\n叛忍\n焰红小队成员\n\n</p><p>能力/技能\n剑术\n炮术\n风遁忍术\n\n</p><p>爱好\n培育豆芽。\n目标\n偷取半藏学院的忍卷(以前)。\n照顾并培养她的战友。\n\n</p><p>家人\n未具名的父母(已故)\n朋友／盟友\n焰\n飞影\n未来\n遥\n凛／铃音\n斑鸠\n飞鸟\n葛城\n云雀\n柳生\n大道寺\n小百合／茉莉\n丛云\n实里\n由美\n式\n夜樱\n雅\n紫\n伊姆\n凉姬\n凉奈\n\n</p><p>敌人\n道元\n英雄类型\n精明的忍者\n悲剧的养育者\n\n</p><p>「\t我将为我们的舞蹈的意志牺牲自我！\t„\n~ Yomi\t\nYomi是《闪乱神乐》系列中的一个角色。她在《闪乱神乐：少女们的肖像》中首次登场，作为次要反派，但后来成为女主角和支持角色。\n\n</p><p>她是一名忍者，属于焰的绯红忍者小队，曾是蛇女学院的学员。\n\n</p><p>日文版由茅野爱衣配音，英文版由Trina Nishimura配音。\n\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYomi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Yomi拥有白皙的肌肤和一头长长的金色头发。她的忍者服装类似于女仆装，这与她的背景故事相契合。这是一件青绿色的连衣裙，下面衬着白色衬裙，还有一件带有手里剑图案的白色围裙，围裙由一条棕色腰带固定，右侧有一个棕色小包，左侧有一个较小的紫色包，还有一排用于十字弩的飞镖。裙子的背面系着一个非常大的白色蝴蝶结。上衣是白色的，到胸线处用褶边收尾，她的白色裙子也有褶边，白色手套的末端也有，手臂上有青绿色的臂环，带有白色褶边、类似十字的小白线和黑色丝带。她穿着长筒棕色靴子，有黑色鞋带，里面穿着白色长袜。还有一顶带有白线的青绿色贝雷帽，背面有一个大白色蝴蝶结。\n\n</p><p>她也曾穿过蛇女学院的制服。但在叛逃并成为叛逆者后，她穿着带有白线的绿色田径服。\n\n</p><p>无论Yomi穿什么服装，她前发上总是别着一个绿色发夹。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYomi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Yomi表现得彬彬有礼、举止得体。虽然她对朋友展现这种态度，但她对敌人却以野蛮、好斗和自负著称，不断嘲讽他们(尤其是那些出身富贵的人)。\n\n</p><p>由于在贫民窟中贫穷长大，Yomi对出生富裕的人怀有强烈的憎恨与嫉妒，视他们为不知艰难生活为何物之人。一旦看到或感受到他人身上带有奢侈气息，她便会因此产生厌恶。不过，她已经学会看待某些人，而非仅仅局限于自己所厌恶的对象。在照顾朋友时，Yomi展现出关怀与母性的一面，会为他们做饭、打扫、照料，仿佛他们是自己家人一般。\n\n</p><p>她同样对豆芽有着巨大的痴迷与珍视。她会在自家花园里用草类培育豆芽，并将其作为制作菜肴的食材。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Yomi_Austere_Ninja_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250617002950\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Yomi Austere Ninja S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8a/Yomi_Austere_Ninja_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250617002950\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1014\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Yomi Austere Ninja S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Yomi_Austere_Ninja_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/ee/Yomi_AN_Frantic_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250620012256\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Yomi AN Frantic Swimsuit Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/ee/Yomi_AN_Frantic_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250620012256\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"970\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Yomi AN Frantic Swimsuit Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Yomi_AN_Frantic_Swimsuit_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821132348\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39944-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821132348 and revision id 64360. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
